WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.590
How do you book me to speak at
your event?

2
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:05.095
It starts with a short form.

3
00:00:05.295 --> 00:00:07.414
Go to the Book Brett page and tell

4
00:00:07.414 --> 00:00:11.496
me about your audience and what
you want them to walk away with.

5
00:00:11.496 --> 00:00:13.065
You'll hear back within

6
00:00:13.065 --> 00:00:16.597
forty-eight hours with
availability and next steps.

7
00:00:16.597 --> 00:00:18.481
Then we have a brief call, so I

8
00:00:18.481 --> 00:00:21.071
understand your people
and your goals.

9
00:00:21.071 --> 00:00:23.583
Every talk is customized
for the room.

10
00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:27.507
Your audience should leave
changed, not just entertained.
